'''Predator''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Predator is primarily a solid black knife, but it also contains streaks of maroon red throughout the blade, guard, and handle.

== Trivia ==
*Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/199611278/Exotic texture] was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/21976216/profile GibbyTheMoonGod], and was uploaded to Roblox on January 2, 2015.
*Players can exchange 12 rare [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain this by chance.
*It has a [[Predator (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

